<item>
            <title>[KYLIN-6007] On the task list page, snapshot tasks cannot be filtered by table name</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-6007</link>
                <project id="12316121" key="KYLIN">Kylin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The &lt;b&gt;table_identity&lt;/b&gt; field in the table metadata is empty, causing incorrect job query condition concatenation.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13608974">KYLIN-6007</key>
            <summary>On the task list page, snapshot tasks cannot be filtered by table name</summary>
